5. Acceptance Criteria

The prototype is considered functional when:

The SOS button is reliably detected.

The emergency indicator activates.

GPS coordinates are correctly read when available.

An emergency message is generated.

The GSM module can send the message when cellular service is available.

The local alarm continues even when GPS or GSM is unavailable.